X "comfortable" state of operations.
X 
X In 4.0F they (Compaq) "fixed it". The original problem for them was not the
X speed, but the possibility of running out of available BMT extents, thus
X being unable create more files although you had space. Agreed, that is a
X problem. They fixed by allowing for a greater number of extents and IGNORING
X those domain creation parameters!
X 
X So, my proxy cache on 4.0F would not run out of BMT (it didn't run out on
X 4.0D either, it was just dead slow), but there was no way to speed it up.
X Imagine my fury. Immediately, I switched back to 4.0D.
X 
