Well, after a week of tries, I have at last found the cause of the problem!
It camed from the conflict between the iconv.h file from tru64 and GNU.

At compilation time, the tru64's iconv.h file was used.
At the execution, my apache was calling the libiconv.so lib file from
Gnu.
I know, this error is really stupid...

