In article <aj8j60$18u9v9$1@ID-126742.news.dfncis.de>, dJon'Z wrote:
> I've just set up a TruCluster v1.6 on two Tru64 4.0g boxes.  Since I've got
> two separate systems with two /etc/passwd files to maintain, I want to
