Scott Skinnider wrote:

> Excuse the ignorance, I am kind of new to unix.  I am trying to unpack
> and install BB on Tru64, I am having a bit of trouble untar'ing the
> files.  it seems the commands I am using don't work.
> gunzip -c filename | tar -xf

gunzip produces no standard output; therefore the pipe will not work.  
Either

gunzip filename.tar.gz; tar xf filename.tar

or gzip -cd filename.tar.gz | tar xf -

BTW, depending on which version of tar you have, if you insist on using 
the - for your options it may be necessary to have the - for each 
option; i.e., tar -x -f.



