 The messages means that the LSM daemon is not runnig on that (V5.x) system,
 probably because it was never initialized. (contrary to HP-UX 11.x volumes
are
 not required to create filesystems on Tru64, it still can use disk
partitioning)

 To initialize LSM, look for a free disk partition (use disklabel to find
one),
 and then use "/usr/sbin/volsetup dsk5h" (supposing you found dsk5
part'h'=unused) to create
 the rootdg diskgroup.
 "voldctl mode" should now respond with 'enabled', and you can start
creating
 volumes and diskgroups.

 Have fun...
  Johan.

